%% User flow: symbol analysis journey
flowchart TD
    U[User] --> S[Enter Symbol]
    S --> API[GET /api/search?q=SYMBOL]
    API --> P[Pattern Engine /api/patterns]
    P --> T[Technical /api/technicals + /api/trend]
    P --> C[Chart /api/candles]
    P --> F[Fundamentals /api/fundamentals]
    T --> D[Decision /api/decision]
    C --> D
    F --> D
    D --> V[Verdict: BUY / HOLD / SELL + confidence + provenance]
    V --> U
